    "story": {
      "type": "product-story",
      "settings": {
        "title": "Built around one button.",
        "source": "manual",
        "layout": "split",
        "media_position_desktop": "left",
        "media_ratio": "portrait",
        "media_fit": "cover",
        "show_media": true,
        "media_type": "image",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/vector-one-06-functional-detail.webp",
        "media_caption": "The temple button: one press answers, two skip, hold for the assistant.",
        "show_timeline": true,
        "timeline_source": "manual",
        "padding_top": 88,
        "padding_bottom": 88,
        "bg_color": "#f5f5f1",
        "surface_color": "#e7e7e2",
        "text_color": "#111111",
        "heading_color": "#111111",
        "muted_text_color": "#545450"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "arc_89": {
          "type": "story_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Early prototypes had touch panels on both temples. People tapped them by accident when adjusting the frame, and nobody could find them without a mirror.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_90": {
          "type": "story_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>So we removed them. Vector One has a single button where your thumb lands when you touch your glasses, and it does three things you can learn in a minute.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_91": {
          "type": "timeline_item",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2023",
            "title": "Fit trials",
            "text": "<p>Forty frame shapes worn for a week each. The square front stayed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_92": {
          "type": "timeline_item",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2024",
            "title": "Audio tuning",
            "text": "<p>Speaker angle set to keep sound at the ear and quiet for the room.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_93": {
          "type": "timeline_item",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2025",
            "title": "One button",
            "text": "<p>Three touch zones replaced by a single physical button people found without looking.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_94": {
          "type": "timeline_item",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2026",
            "title": "Release",
            "text": "<p>Vector One ships in Graphite and Alloy.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "arc_89",
        "arc_90",
        "arc_91",
        "arc_92",
        "arc_93",
        "arc_94"
      ]
    },
